        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014*indescribable penguin sounds*\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wh- what's that? Baws's makin' all kinds of crazy sounds!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hey, wasn't that box of vinyl records some kind of black market Columbian collectible thingy?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I reckon yer right. What're we gonna do? I ain't never seen the baws all choked up like this before...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean\u2014\u2014 Hey! They're getting away! Those guys in black!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! If they were here setting that trap, why didn't they just ambush us? This isn't adding up. We need to take a minute and come up with a plan before\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$sportscarstart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chasing_intro",
        "key": "$chasing_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Listen up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can expense your speeding tickets tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "They gotta pay... for my vinyl recoooords!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$drift"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_motorway",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got 'em! Dead ahead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai! Pass me my Lil Homie!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You got it, boss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that a gun?! But how are you going to pull the trigger...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! See for yourself, little man. Let our firearms expert tell you about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's forty-two layers of logistics-grade cardboard, seamlessly glued together with industrial adhesive, driven by the finest rubber bands. It's really a magnificent piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean... it's a toy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's more of a slingshot\u2014\u2014Ow! Err, it's a peacemaker!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't use live ammo in downtown Lungmen. That's the law.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet this is the only time the boss seems to care what the law says.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If nobody follows the rules, our whole society goes to hell, you feel me? Texas, put the top down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful. Don't want you hitting your head on a traffic signal like last time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I look that tall to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Support sniper in position, boss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "W- wait a minute, there's a lot of other cars on the road. Don't tell me you're just gonna\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
